---
name: Map an OpenSSH message to OCSF
description: |
  Normalizes a Syslog event carrying an `sshd` message to OCSF. The normalizer
  takes the timestamp and host from the Syslog envelope and retains the source
  message in `raw_data`.
---

from {
  timestamp: 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z,
  hostname: "bastion-01",
  message: "Failed password for invalid user admin from 198.51.100.42 port 49152 ssh2",
}
openssh::ocsf::normalize
ocsf_derive
